This Power BI dashboard provides a complete overview of Olist’s e‑commerce performance, combining customer, order, payment, product, and geographic insights.
Key KPIs highlight total orders, revenue, customer satisfaction, and unique customer activity.
Interactive visuals reveal monthly trends, payment behavior, top‑selling products, and city‑level order distribution.
The dashboard demonstrates end‑to‑end analytics skills using PostgreSQL, SQL, and Power BI.
